{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1153576,\"title\":\"Street Fighter\",\"tagline\":\"Ready. Set. Fight.\",\"overview\":\"In 1993, estranged Street Fighters Ryu and Ken Masters are thrown back into combat when the mysterious Chun-Li recruits them for the next World Warrior Tournament: a brutal clash of fists, fate, and fury. But behind this battle royale lies a deadly conspiracy that forces them to face off against each other and the demons of their past. And if they don't, it's GAME OVER!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ccxdepKqORLwccbzvO4eAGkN0IC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zDE9hd1SG9695YncbZGjSf7Z9Jk.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":258,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":120,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":82000000,\"revenue\":100752804,\"director\":\"Kitao Sakurai\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":922344,\"name\":\"Kitao Sakurai\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9uaITTRb3OOdkV9ujcUTd9f9cp7.jpg\"},{\"id\":1658375,\"name\":\"Andrew Koji\",\"character\":\"Ryu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oU53nWLQ6wFHzERwSi1fD53LxZB.jpg\"},{\"id\":1253353,\"name\":\"Noah Centineo\",\"character\":\"Ken Masters\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p1bcst401RyxfDGykx2iQLI7CV5.jpg\"},{\"id\":3775598,\"name\":\"Callina Liang\",\"character\":\"Chun-Li\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/blJ4iEqMs5oTiKVxUyB9Ky7kNRO.jpg\"},{\"id\":83854,\"name\":\"David Dastmalchian\",\"character\":\"M. Bison\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eLafwcpL64CqzwjjSgKpO7Rv4ae.jpg\"},{\"id\":1880755,\"name\":\"Andrew Schulz\",\"character\":\"Dan Hibiki\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fdeYq1EraYvlYM3VmGXjIaSGoTz.jpg\"},{\"id\":222912,\"name\":\"Cody Rhodes\",\"character\":\"Guile\",\"photo\":\"https:/