byTbrvRUDKN2mcNEuVor4VFQW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4JKluvwcYvhkTNvWP5N3kcUNsPl.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It's the 1940s, and the notorious Axe Gang terrorizes Shanghai. Small-time criminals Sing and Bone hope to join, but they only manage to make lots of very dangerous enemies. Fortunately for them, kung fu masters and hidden strength can be found in unlikely places. Now they just have to take on the entire Axe Gang.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":616037,\"title\":\"Thor: Love and Thunder\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pIkRyD18kl4FhoCNQuWxWu5cBLM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jsoz1HlxczSuTx0mDl2h0lxy36l.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After his retirement is interrupted by Gorr the God Butcher, a galactic killer who seeks the extinction of the gods, Thor Odinson enlists the help of King Valkyrie, Korg, and ex-girlfriend Jane Foster, who now wields Mjolnir as the Mighty Thor. Together they embark upon a harrowing cosmic adventure to uncover the mystery of the God Butcher’s vengeance and stop him before it’s too late.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11770,\"title\":\"Shaolin Soccer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z6ZQqwoxWy9muIxwUP4K2zWw7BU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lMRX4cLx4hxYth3iQ96c0E1RHGB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young Shaolin follower reunites with his discouraged brothers to form a soccer team using their martial art skills to their advantage.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":594767,\"title\":\"Shazam! Fury of the Gods\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3GrRgt6CiLIUXUtoktcv1g2iwT5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kQV9sV0IbastbU5FYxuYwxfMawz.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Billy Batson and his foster siblings, who transform into superheroes by saying \\\"Shazam!\\\", are forced to get back into action and fight the Daughters of Atlas, who they must stop from using a weapon that could destroy the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":287947,\"title\":\"Shazam!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xnopI5Xtky18MPhK40cZAGAOVeV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o7JVhqMmrex1TPbmuxl8YXVlcfl.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A boy is given the ability to become an adult superhero in times of need with a single magic word.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":899112,\"title\":\"Violent Night\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e8CpMgdyihz9Td7amQDqubPuzfN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sBOenwOZGRN5nZZGw4TxwtnfrEf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a team of mercenaries breaks into a wealthy family compound on Christmas Eve, taking everyone inside hostage, the team isn’t prepared for a surprise combatant: Santa Claus is on the grounds, and he’s about to show why this Nick is no saint.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":43074,\"title\":\"Ghostbusters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wJmWliwXIgZOCCVOcGRBhce7xPS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3KDHaahgXlUhmpXzoRZrLc7QSBM.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following a ghost invasion of Manhattan, paranormal enthusiasts Erin Gilbert and Abby Yates, nuclear engineer Jillian Holtzmann, and subway worker Patty Tolan band together to stop the otherworldly threat.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":18360,\"title\":\"Night at the Museum: Battle of the Smithsonian\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l9yAQn6TyrA3gv5xZZkiMMoZsiw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zdhICEDUlBTQ43fQMa2KJt8fDFX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Hapless museum night watchman Larry Daley must help his living, breathing exhibit friends out of a pickle now that they've been transferred to the archives at the Smithsonian Institution. Larry's (mis)adventures this time include close encounters with Amelia Earhart, Abe Lincoln and Ivan the Terrible.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11653,\"title\":\"The Myth\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iBDFnLkTZZxQlbb6IIeYkufnPCY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xChyWmjDeEH8zOVi9dwVrtIJEfd.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a fellow scientist asks for Jack's help in locating the mausoleum of China's first emperor, the past collides violently with the present as Jack discovers his amazing visions are based in fact.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4442,\"title\":\"The Brothers Grimm\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iPrey2UYrA5Fqa8L3KnxqMqfmSq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aDfGKWdtNHzDmnHkdDyXz7zoDuy.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Folklore collectors and con artists, Jake and Will Grimm, travel from village to village pretending to protect townsfolk from enchanted creatures and performing exorcisms. However, they are put to the test when they encounter a real magical curse in a haunted forest with real magical beings, requiring genuine courage.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":49524,\"title\":\"R.I.P.D.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rS0kByPD4YF8pQ85KjzMdGiu7Xf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6KJcFFE1iBPC0Xj0iPCcmMvS5WK.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A recently slain cop joins a team of undead police officers working for the Rest in Peace Department and tries to find the man who murdered him.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"U6sbm1OaJb8\",\"name\":\"New Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Xt4X4FvXk2A\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"YoC737pGAE8\",\"name\":\"Popcorn Meter\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}